          "entities": {},
          "text": "This is bad: \nat temperature=1.0 and without the presence penalty, Qwen3.5 35B can't even complete Live Code Bench.\n\nStuck in thinking loops.\n\nOn an RTX Pro 6000, it slows down to 5 tps with vLLM and 4 concurrent queries. It'd take a week or more to know the results.\n\nLowering the temperature, as recommended in the model card, should work, but even at temperature = 0.2, it can still get stuck.\n\nQwen3.5 will cost us a lot of tokens."
